# The library release this site mirrors its repository themes from — §7.5.
#
# ATOMIC AND PINNED TO A PUBLISHED RELEASE TAG, so the themes a reader can register and the
# command the site offers to install are two statements about the same artefact. The command
# is what registers a theme, so the pin follows the command's train, not the engine's.
#
# Raising it is the whole of an upgrade: scripts/fetch-themes.sh reads this file, and nothing
# else names a tag.
cli-v1.2.1
